				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Use the existing code-change tools for changes and existing example and SUnit tools for meaningful checks. Use evaluation only to inspect or exercise objects, not to compile code or delete files. Environment builds must go through BVC. Do not add scripts, dependencies or infrastructure without the user's agreement."
