					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Keep the result reviewable: describe the changed behavior, affected classes and methods, actual check results, and any remaining limits. Do not claim a fresh BVC build or GemStone validation unless it happened. Do not delegate, deploy, send external messages or modify a production system. Changes to AI instructions require an explicit documentation task; editable pages are not a way to enlarge tool authority."
